              </p>
              <p className="mt-1 text-xs leading-5 text-slate-500">
                Choose your role and complete the application below with accurate
                information.
              </p>
            </div>

            <span className="shrink-0 rounded-xl bg-white px-4 py-2.5 text-xs font-bold text-blue-700 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-blue-100">
              Continue to application ↓
            </span>
          </div>
        </section>


        <div


          id="mobile-application-cta"


          className="mb-6 lg:hidden"


        >


          <a


            href="#application-form"


            className="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 rounded-2xl bg-blue-600 px-5 py-4 text-white shadow-[0_10px_30px_rgba(37,99,235,0.22)] transition active:scale-[0.99]"


          >


            <span>


              <span className="block text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-blue-100">


                Ready to apply?


              </span>


              <span className="mt-1 block text-sm font-black">


                Start your Growth Network application


              </span>


            </span>


            <span className="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-white/15 text-lg">


              →


            </span>


          </a>


        </div>



        <div className="grid items-start gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[280px_minmax(0,1fr)] lg:gap-8 xl:grid-cols-[300px_minmax(0,980px)] xl:justify-center">
          <aside className="hidden lg:sticky lg:top-[102px] lg:block">
            <div className="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgba(15,23,42,0.04)]">
              <div className="border-b border-slate-100 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 via-white to-white p-6">
                <div className="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-blue-600 text-white shadow-lg shadow-blue-600/20">
                  <Handshake size={20} />
                </div>

                <p className="mt-5 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-blue-600">
                  Application
                </p>

                <h2 className="mt-1 text-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-950">
                  Growth Network
                </h2>

                <p className="mt-2 text-xs leading-5 text-slate-500">
                  Complete the application and our team will review your
                  information before onboarding.
                </p>
              </div>

              <nav className="p-3">
                {sections.map(([id, number, label]) => {
                  const active = activeSection === id;

                  return (
                    <button
                      key={id}
                      type="button"
                      onClick={() => scrollToSection(id)}
                      className={`group flex w-full items-center gap-3 rounded-xl px-3 py-3 text-left transition ${
                        active
                          ? "bg-blue-50 text-blue-700"
                          : "text-slate-500 hover:bg-slate-50 hover:text-slate-800"
                      }`}
                    >
                      <span
                        className={`flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-[10px] font-bold ${
                          active
                            ? "bg-blue-600 text-white"
                            : "bg-slate-100 text-slate-500 group-hover:bg-slate-200"
                        }`}
                      >
                        {number}
                      </span>

                      <span className="flex-1 text-xs font-semibold">
                        {label}
                      </span>

                      {active && <ChevronRight size={15} />}
                    </button>
                  );
                })}
              </nav>

              <div className="border-t border-slate-100 p-4">
                <div className="flex gap-3 rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 p-3.5">
                  <ShieldCheck
                    size={17}
                    className="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-emerald-600"
                  />
                  <p className="text-[11px] leading-5 text-slate-600">
                    Applications are reviewed before onboarding. Applying
                    does not guarantee selection.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </aside>

          <form
            onSubmit={handleSubmit}
            className="min-w-0 scroll-mt-6 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-[0_12px_40px_rgba(15,23,42,0.07)]"
          
            id="application-form"
          >
            <div className="border-b border-slate-100 px-5 py-6 sm:px-8 lg:px-10">
              <div className="flex flex-col justify-between gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center">
                <div>
                  <p className="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-blue-600">
                    Apply to join
                  </p>

                  <h2 className="mt-1 text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-950">
                    Tell us about yourself
                  </h2>

                  <p className="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">
                    Please provide accurate information so our team can review
                    your application.
                  </p>
                </div>

                <div className="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-3.5 py-2">
                  <div className="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500" />
                  <span className="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600">
                    Application open
                  </span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <section
              id="role"
              className="scroll-mt-28 border-b border-slate-100 px-6 py-8 sm:px-8 lg:px-10 lg:py-10"
            >
              <SectionHeading
                number="01"
                title="Choose your role"
                description="Select how you want to contribute to the Growth Network."
                icon={Users}
              />

              <div className="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2">
                {[
                  {
                    value: "TEAM_LEADER" as const,
                    icon: Users,
                    title: "Team Leader",
                    description:
                      "Lead and coordinate a Growth Network team.",
                  },
                  {
                    value: "EXECUTIVE" as const,
                    icon: Megaphone,
                    title: "Growth Executive",
                    description:
                      "Participate in outreach and student acquisition.",
                  },
                ].map((role) => {
                  const selected = memberType === role.value;
                  const Icon = role.icon;

                  return (
                    <button
                      key={role.value}
                      type="button"
                      onClick={() => setMemberType(role.value)}
                      className={`group relative rounded-2xl border p-5 text-left transition-all ${
                        selected
                          ? "border-blue-500 bg-blue-50/60 shadow-[0_0_0_3px_rgba(37,99,235,0.08)]"
                          : "border-slate-200 bg-white hover:border-blue-200 hover:bg-slate-50/60"
                      }`}
                    >
                      <div className="flex items-start justify-between">
                        <div
                          className={`flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl transition ${
                            selected
                              ? "bg-blue-600 text-white shadow-lg shadow-blue-600/20"
                              : "bg-slate-100 text-slate-500 group-hover:bg-blue-50 group-hover:text-blue-600"
                          }`}
                        >
                          <Icon size={20} />
                        </div>

                        <div
                          className={`flex h-6 w-6 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 ${
                            selected
                              ? "border-blue-600 bg-blue-600 text-white"
                              : "border-slate-300 bg-white text-transparent"
                          }`}
                        >
                          <Check size={13} strokeWidth={3} />
                        </div>
                      </div>

                      <h3 className="mt-6 text-base font-bold text-slate-950">
                        {role.title}
                      </h3>

                      <p className="mt-1.5 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-500">
                        {role.description}
                      </p>

                      <div
                        className={`mt-5 flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-bold ${
                          selected ? "text-blue-600" : "text-slate-400"
                        }`}
                      >
                        {selected ? "Selected" : "Select role"}
                        <ChevronRight size={14} />
                      </div>
                    </button>
                  );
                })}
              </div>
            </section>

            <section
              id="personal"
              className="scroll-mt-28 border-b border-slate-100 px-6 py-8 sm:px-8 lg:px-10 lg:py-10"
            >
              <SectionHeading
                number="02"
                title="Personal information"
                description="Basic information required for application and communication."
                icon={BriefcaseBusiness}
              />

              <div className="grid gap-x-5 gap-y-5 md:grid-cols-2">
                <div>
                  <FieldLabel required>Full name</FieldLabel>
                  <input
                    name="name"
                    required
                    className={inputClass}
                    placeholder="Enter your full name"
                  />
                </div>

                <div>
                  <FieldLabel required>Email address</FieldLabel>
                  <input
                    name="email"
                    type="email"
                    required
                    className={inputClass}
                    placeholder="you@example.com"
                  />
                </div>

                <div>
                  <FieldLabel required>Phone number</FieldLabel>
                  <input
                    name="phone"
                    required
                    inputMode="numeric"
                    pattern="[0-9]{10}"
                    maxLength={10}
                    className={inputClass}
                    placeholder="10-digit mobile number"
                  />
                </div>

                <div>
                  <FieldLabel>City</FieldLabel>
                  <input
                    name="city"
                    className={inputClass}
                    placeholder="Your city"
                  />
                </div>

                <div>
                  <FieldLabel>State</FieldLabel>
                  <input
                    name="state"
                    className={inputClass}
                    placeholder="Your state"
                  />
                </div>

                <div>
                  <FieldLabel>Education</FieldLabel>
                  <input
                    name="education"
                    className={inputClass}
                    placeholder="Highest qualification"
                  />
                </div>

                <div>
                  <FieldLabel>Current occupation</FieldLabel>
                  <input
                    name="occupation"
                    className={inputClass}
                    placeholder="Student / Professional / Business"
                  />
                </div>

                <div>
                  <FieldLabel>Organization / College</FieldLabel>
                  <input
                    name="organization"
                    className={inputClass}
                    placeholder="Optional"
                  />
                </div>
              </div>
            </section>

            <section
              id="experience"
              className="scroll-mt-28 border-b border-slate-100 px-6 py-8 sm:px-8 lg:px-10 lg:py-10"
            >
              <SectionHeading
                number="03"
                title="Experience & availability"
                description="Help us understand your practical experience and the time you can contribute."
                icon={GraduationCap}
              />

              <div className="grid gap-x-5 gap-y-5 md:grid-cols-2">
                <div>
                  <FieldLabel>Relevant experience</FieldLabel>
                  <textarea
                    name="experience"
                    rows={4}
                    className={textareaClass}
                    placeholder="Marketing, sales, outreach, counselling, networking, etc."
                  />
                </div>

                <div>
                  <FieldLabel>Availability</FieldLabel>
                  <textarea
                    name="availability"
                    rows={4}
                    className={textareaClass}
                    placeholder="Example: 2–3 hours daily, evenings or weekends"
                  />
                </div>

                <div>
                  <FieldLabel>Preferred working mode</FieldLabel>
                  <select
                    name="workingMode"
                    defaultValue=""
                    className={`${inputClass} appearance-none`}
                  >
                    <option value="">Select working mode</option>
                    <option value="Remote">Remote</option>
                    <option value="Hybrid">Hybrid</option>
                    <option value="Offline">Offline</option>
                  </select>
                </div>

                <div>
                  <FieldLabel>Leadership experience</FieldLabel>
                  <textarea
                    name="leadershipExperience"
                    rows={4}
                    className={textareaClass}
                    placeholder="Describe any team coordination or leadership experience."
                  />
                </div>

                <div>
                  <FieldLabel>Previous team size</FieldLabel>
                  <input
                    name="previousTeamSize"
                    className={inputClass}
                    placeholder="Example: 5"
                  />
                </div>

                <div>
                  <FieldLabel>Expected team size</FieldLabel>
                  <input
                    name="expectedTeamSize"
                    className={inputClass}
                    placeholder={
                      memberType === "TEAM_LEADER"
                        ? "For Team Leader applicants"
                        : "Optional"
                    }
                  />
                </div>
              </div>
            </section>

            <section
              id="profiles"
              className="scroll-mt-28 border-b border-slate-100 px-6 py-8 sm:px-8 lg:px-10 lg:py-10"
            >
              <SectionHeading
                number="04"
                title="Online presence"
                description="Optional links that may help us understand your professional presence."
                icon={Globe2}
              />

              <div className="grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3">
                <div>
                  <FieldLabel>LinkedIn URL</FieldLabel>
                  <input
                    name="linkedinUrl"
                    type="url"
                    className={inputClass}
                    placeholder="LinkedIn profile"
                  />
                </div>

                <div>
                  <FieldLabel>Instagram URL</FieldLabel>
                  <input
                    name="instagramUrl"
                    type="url"
                    className={inputClass}
                    placeholder="Instagram profile"
                  />
                </div>

                <div>
                  <FieldLabel>Portfolio URL</FieldLabel>
                  <input
                    name="portfolioUrl"
                    type="url"
                    className={inputClass}
                    placeholder="Portfolio / website"
                  />
                </div>
              </div>
            </section>

            <section
              id="referral"
              className="scroll-mt-28 border-b border-slate-100 px-6 py-8 sm:px-8 lg:px-10 lg:py-10"
            >
              <SectionHeading
                number="05"
                title="Referral information"
                description="If a Growth Network member referred you, enter their referral code."
                icon={Handshake}
              />

              <div className="max-w-xl">
                <FieldLabel>Referral code</FieldLabel>

                <div className="relative">
                  <Handshake
                    size={17}
                    className="pointer-events-none absolute left-4 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-slate-400"
                  />

                  <input
                    name="ref"
                    value={referralCode}
                    onChange={(event) =>
                      setReferralCode(event.target.value)
                    }
                    className={`${inputClass} pl-11 uppercase`}
                    placeholder="Optional referral code"
                  />
                </div>

                <p className="mt-2 text-xs text-slate-400">
                  Leave this blank if you were not referred by an existing
                  member.
                </p>
              </div>
            </section>

            <section
              id="declarations"
              className="scroll-mt-28 px-6 py-8 sm:px-8 lg:px-10 lg:py-10"
            >
              <SectionHeading
                number="06"
                title="Responsibilities & declarations"
                description="Please review and confirm each statement before submitting your application."
                icon={ShieldCheck}
              />

              <div className="space-y-3">
                <Declaration name="responsibilitiesAccepted">
                  I understand and accept the responsibilities associated
                  with my selected Growth Network role.
                </Declaration>

                <Declaration name="declarationsAccepted">
                  I confirm that the information provided in this application
                  is accurate to the best of my knowledge.
                </Declaration>

                <Declaration
                  name="marketingPolicyAccepted"
                  accent
                >
                  I agree to follow TechSkillHub&apos;s marketing,
                  communication and outreach guidelines and will not make
                  unauthorized promises or claims.
                </Declaration>

                <Declaration name="termsAccepted">
                  I understand that submitting this application does not
                  guarantee selection, onboarding, admission-related work,
                  or commission.
                </Declaration>
              </div>

              <div className="mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-emerald-100 bg-emerald-50/60 p-5">
                <div className="flex gap-3">
                  <div className="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-white text-emerald-600 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-emerald-100">
                    <ShieldCheck size={18} />
                  </div>

                  <div>
                    <p className="text-sm font-bold text-slate-800">
                      Before you submit
                    </p>

                    <p className="mt-1 text-xs leading-5 text-slate-500">
                      No investment is required to apply. Selection and
                      onboarding are subject to TechSkillHub review and
                      applicable requirements.
                    </p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              {error && (
                <div className="mt-5 rounded-xl border border-red-200 bg-red-50 px-4 py-3.5 text-sm font-medium leading-6 text-red-700">
                  {error}
                </div>
              )}

              <div className="mt-8 flex flex-col justify-between gap-5 border-t border-slate-100 pt-7 sm:flex-row sm:items-center">
                <div>
                  <p className="text-sm font-bold text-slate-800">
                    Ready to apply?
                  </p>
                  <p className="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-400">
                    Review your information before submitting.
                  </p>
                </div>

                <button
                  type="submit"
                  disabled={loading}
                  className="inline-flex min-w-[210px] items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-blue-600 px-6 py-3.5 text-sm font-bold text-white shadow-lg shadow-blue-600/20 transition-all hover:bg-blue-700 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-60"
                >
                  {loading ? (
                    <>
                      <Loader2 size={17} className="animate-spin" />
                      Submitting...
                    </>
                  ) : (
                    <>
                      Submit application
                      <ArrowRight size={17} />
                    </>
                  )}
                </button>
              </div>
            </section>
          </form>
        </div>
      </div>

      <footer className="border-t border-slate-200 bg-white">
        <div className="mx-auto flex max-w-[1440px] flex-col gap-2 px-5 py-6 text-xs text-slate-400 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between sm:px-8 lg:px-12">
          <p>© 2026 TechSkillHub. All rights reserved.</p>

          <div className="flex items-center gap-2">
            <ShieldCheck size={14} className="text-emerald-500" />
            <span>Secure Growth Network application portal</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </footer>
    </main>
  );
}
